      "side": 1,
      "message": "The possible error codes returned here are:\n* `INVALID_PARAMETERS`\n* `DENIED`\n* `NO_MEMORY`\n* `ABORTED`\n\nI think the only value where TZ hasn\u0027t relinquished the pages is `DENIED`; the others are legitimate errors that we should handle as such.",
